{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>Slothfulness</b> — a noun on the pattern of מותה כבשה, that is, slothfulness casts deep sleep upon the sluggard, and likewise the soul that schemes to deceive others — it will go hungry." "<b>And deceit</b> — on the pattern of צדיה."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:23:38.862761940Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}